	(text "BEFORE FIRST POWER-ON: remove the L298N 5V-EN, ENA and ENB jumpers, turn the PAM8403 volume to minimum, and measure the charger output (8.4V max) before connecting the cells."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 8 378 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4e24113b-192e-4b84-9928-a07a19f4516e")
	)
	(text "POWER: 2x18650 in series -> BMS. Charger and load share BMS P+/P-. Fuse -> switch -> VSW feeds the L298N 12V pin and the DC-DC input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 8 350 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "71f367b6-800d-48fb-8fa8-bef3ecd506c4")
	)
	(text "Every net is drawn with wires. Net labels only name the nets (same name = same net)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 8 364 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "76866b18-2e2e-4768-aa10-bacae9fe3f86")
	)
	(text "Only the ESP32-S3 is fed through the 1N5819 (5V_ESP), so USB-C can be plugged in safely. 5V_RAIL feeds PAM8403, HC-SR04 and L298N logic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 8 357 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9feddf40-62ce-4915-a0ef-c535bf51e74b")
	)
	(text "GPIO 35-37 are used by the octal PSRAM (N16R8). GPIO 0,3,45,46 strapping, 19/20 USB, 43/44 UART left unused. GPIO 2,38,40,41,42,47 are free."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 8 371 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dcdfe468-8237-4fc7-bead-49ee1d2355a1")
	)
